# Byte-stability for hashed/parsed artifacts: these files are checksummed
# (migration sha256 pin) or parsed line-wise by tests, so they must check
# out with LF on every platform regardless of core.autocrlf.
migrations/statistics/*.sql text eol=lf
docs/generated/statistics-schema-v1.sql text eol=lf
docs/DOSSIER-SOURCES.md text eol=lf
